Day 23/120

This Excel unguided dashboard project has stretched me in ways I didn’t expect.

When I started guided projects, I had steps.
Now?
It’s just me, the dataset, and my thinking process.

No one telling me what measure to create.
No one telling me which chart to use.
No one confirming if  I’m doing it right.

And I won’t lie, some days I stare at the screen longer than I’d like to admit.

I’ve rebuilt visuals.
Deleted measures.
Questioned my logic.
Second-guessed my KPIs.

This project has tested my patience, sharpened my problem-solving, and challenged my confidence.
Growth is uncomfortable…but necessary.
